Test assets

- avatars/*.png except deploybot.png: generated with DiceBear (https://www.dicebear.com)
  from the "Lorelei" style by Lisa Wischofsky — CC0 1.0 Universal.
- avatars/deploybot.png: DiceBear "Bottts Neutral" by Pablo Stanley — free for
  personal and commercial use (https://bottts.com).
- Everything else (workspace.png, images/, icons/, files/, canvases/, gifs/,
  webp/, audio/, fixture.json), the SVG renderer's fixtures in svg/ and the COLRv1
  test font in fonts/ (built by fonts/make_colrv1_test.py): drawn from
  primitives, synthesised or written by hand for msga — same license as the
  msga repository.

The people, company and services depicted are fictional.
